# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim). A soft stinger for a cube memorized (got through; docs/story.md), when the story goes in.
# Not played by the game yet: only in tools/player.html, under Jingles.
# Every cube gets it, so it has to stay small: one soft ring.
title    Memorized
composer Claude
about    A place she will not forget again: one soft ring, the bird's wide pair (A and B) on a glass harmonica swelling in and fading, with a glass tap.
tempo    80
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.6

# mood explore: ring tap

voice ring     glassharp  vol=0.24 pan=0.2  rev=0.8 att=0.2 rel=1
voice tap      glasstap   vol=0.22 pan=-0.2

pattern ring
ring    | A5+B5----------- |
tap     | x..... ...... |

loop ring
